{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20107","headline":"送李翺习之 · 孟郊","name":"送李翺习之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"习之势翩翩，东南去遥遥。\n赠君双履足，一爲上臯桥。\n臯桥路逶迤，碧水清风飘。\n新秋折藕花，应对吴语娇。\n千巷分渌波，四门生早潮。\n湖榜轻褭褭，酒旗高寥寥。\n小时屐齿痕，有处应未销。\n旧忆如雾星，怳见於梦消。\n言之烧人心，事去不可招。\n独孤宅前曲，箜篌醉中谣。\n壮年俱悠悠，逮兹各焦焦。\n执手复执手，唯道无枯凋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20107.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20107","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}